WEBVTT

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.143
Going back to the beginning
of our country --

00:13:31.167 --> 00:13:34.167
historically, defenses meant
protection of the homeland.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.976
Security has meant everything else.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.976
Written into our constitution,

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.976
two different forces,
two different functions.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.976
Raise an army when you need it,

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:49.976
and maintain a navy
for day-to-day connectivity.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:53.976
A Department of War,
a Department of Everything Else.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.000
A big stick, a baton stick.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.000
Can of whup ass,